{"seq":4,"slug":"code-formatting-linting","title":"代码格式化与 Lint 工具","stage":"DONE","category":"editors-compilers","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.32,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 代码格式化与 Lint 工具 简介\n\n代码格式化与 Lint 工具是现代软件开发中不可或缺的基础设施，它们自动化地保障代码风格一致性和质量标准，让开发者将注意力集中在业务逻辑而非排版细节上。本知识库系统梳理从经典工具到下一代方案的完整技术图景，帮助你在团队中建立高效的代码质量体系。\n\n本知识库适合具备一定前端或后端开发经验的中高级工程师，尤其适合负责项目基础设施建设、团队规范制定和 CI/CD 流程设计的技术负责人。无论你是在选型评估不同工具，还是在设计团队级的代码规范策略，都能从中找到系统化的解答。\n\n第1章**格式化原理**从 AST 驱动的格式化机制讲起，深入解析 Prettier 的设计哲学与工作原理，介绍 EditorConfig 的跨编辑器配置方案，并回顾代码格式化工具的演进历程，帮助你理解\"为什么这样格式化\"。\n\n第2章**ESLint 深入实践**系统讲解 ESLint 的架构设计、自定义规则开发、配置体系设计以及全新的 Flat Config 模式，帮助你从 ESLint 使用者成长为规则制定者。\n\n第3章**下一代工具**聚焦 Biome、oxlint 等新兴工具，对比分析它们与传统方案的性能差异和功能特点，并提供从旧工具迁移到新工具的实操指南。\n\n第4章**团队协作与 CI 集成**将工具能力与工程流程结合，讲解 lint-staged、husky 的 Git 钩子配置、CI 管线中的 Lint 策略、Monorepo 环境下的 Lint 方案以及代码审查自动化。\n\n建议学习路径：先从第1章理解格式化的底层原理，再通过第2章深入 ESLint 的高级用法，然后了解第3章的新工具趋势，最后通过第4章将所有工具串联到团队工作流中。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"formatting-principles","title":"格式化原理","docCount":4,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ast-based-formatting","title":"基于 AST 的格式化原理","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/ast-based-formatting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prettier-deep-dive","title":"Prettier 深度解析","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/prettier-deep-dive"},{"seq":3,"slug":"editorconfig","title":"EditorConfig 与编辑器统一配置","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/editorconfig"},{"seq":4,"slug":"formatting-history","title":"代码格式化工具演进史","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/formatting-history"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"eslint-in-depth","title":"ESLint 深入实践","docCount":4,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/eslint-in-depth","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eslint-architecture","title":"ESLint 架构与工作原理","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/eslint-in-depth/eslint-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"custom-rules","title":"自定义 ESLint 规则开发","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/eslint-in-depth/custom-rules"},{"seq":3,"slug":"eslint-config-design","title":"ESLint 配置体系设计","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/eslint-in-depth/eslint-config-design"},{"seq":4,"slug":"eslint-flat-config","title":"ESLint Flat Config 迁移与实践","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/eslint-in-depth/eslint-flat-config"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"next-gen-tools","title":"下一代工具","docCount":4,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"biome-overview","title":"Biome 全面解析","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/biome-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"oxlint-overview","title":"OXC 与 oxlint 概览","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/oxlint-overview"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tool-comparison","title":"新一代工具横向对比","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/tool-comparison"},{"seq":4,"slug":"migration-guide","title":"迁移指南：从 ESLint/Prettier 到新一代工具","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/migration-guide"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"team-ci-integration","title":"团队协作与 CI 集成","docCount":4,"url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lint-staged-husky","title":"lint-staged 与 Husky 实战","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration/lint-staged-husky"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ci-pipeline-lint","title":"CI 流水线中的 Lint 集成","url":"/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration/ci-pipeline-lint"},{"seq":3,"slug":"monorepo-lint-strat